    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42338" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sălĭsātĭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">salissātĭo</span></b> ), ōnis,
